  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">댬<ruby style=\"position: relative\">댬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">빵<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hk5Z0NP2yjs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世界<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`개</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">每日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뮈ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">認真<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤진ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tiàm-jît-e-sè-kai goà mûi-rît lông-rin-jîn’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">媠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쉬`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家己<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">主人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-e-siong-sùi’e bāng goà si-goà kā-kī’e jû-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬恬<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做工<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">죄`강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬恬<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍拚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬恬<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">댬댬ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">面色<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삔셱</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쇃ˆ-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">재ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tiam-tiam-joè-kâng tiam-tiam-phâh-pia̰ tiam-tiām lêh-khoà̰-láng’e bin-siek soâh-m-jâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天光<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">틸ˉ긍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">了後<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變成<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">款<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">콴`</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thḭ̄-kn̂g liâu-āu goà bêh-pien-sieng-siâ̰-khoàn’e láng?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #5 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">細漢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇠`한</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相片<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셩`필</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一張<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一張<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇듈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">紀念<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">기`럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    soè-han’e siòng-phḭ jit-tiṵ̄-jit-tiṵ̂ lông-si-kì-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #6 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時間<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">走<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄌᅷ`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感覺<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-kân lêh-jàu lông-bo-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #7 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">走揣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄌᅷˆ췌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">希望<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">管<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">前路<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">졩러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">坎欹<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">캄ˆ캬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jâu-chue-goà’e hī-bāng m-koân-jieng-lōr khâm-khiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #8 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    됴<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">算<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">승`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재ˉ얄`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt